              "content": "The Order Preview request is a transaction between the integrator and Synthego. The integrator provides a list of desired guide RNA sequences, a label for sequence, and the product type. Synthego returns an Order Preview response, containing an itemized list with per-item pricing for the guide RNA, a pre-shipping subtotal for the entire request, and a unique URL to redirect the customer to in order to complete the purchase transaction.",
